# 📊 Greenhouse Recruitment Case Study Presentation Generator

> TA-ready AI workflow for analysing Greenhouse recruitment data and automatically producing a 12-slide 'image' hiring case study presentation for Ocado Group. Insert XLS data from ATS Req.

---

## 🚀 Overview

This prompt transforms Greenhouse recruitment data into a polished executive presentation.

It performs:

- 📥 Data intake & validation
- 📈 Recruitment funnel analysis
- 📊 Hiring metrics calculation
- 💷 Interview cost modelling
- 📅 Timeline analysis
- 🎯 Recruitment performance reporting
- 🖥️ Automatic generation of a structured 12-slide presentation

Designed for recruitment teams, Talent Intelligence, HR Analytics and executive stakeholders.

