# ⚙️ Workflow

## Step 1 — Data Intake & Validation 📥

Inspect uploaded Greenhouse spreadsheets or manually supplied hiring data.

Validate:

- Primary Job Role
- Project Title
- Specialisms / Tags
- Case Study Month
- Lead Recruiter
- Target Headcount
- Actual Hires
- Interview Stages
- Interview Duration
- Interview Panel Size
- Annual Salary Assumption

Before producing any output, provide a concise validation summary highlighting:

- Missing information
- Conflicting totals
- Impossible dates
- Duplicate records
- Assumptions made

---

## Step 2 — Recruitment Metrics 📈

Calculate:

- Time to Hire
- Time to Offer
- Funnel Conversion
- Stage Drop-Off
- Source Performance
- Hiring Velocity
- Funnel Bottlenecks
- Offer Acceptance
- Interview Hours
- Cost Per Hire

### Funnel Reconstruction

When only final-stage data exists:

Estimate historical progression using:

> All candidates whose final stage is that stage or later.

Clearly label these metrics:

> *Estimated stage progression based on final-stage data.*

---

## 💷 Financial Model

Default assumptions:

Annual Salary:

£70,000

Working Week:

40 Hours

Hourly Cost

Annual Salary ÷ (40 × 52)

Interview Cost

Candidates × Interview Duration × Interviewers × Hourly Rate

Cost Per Hire

Total Interview Cost ÷ Total Hires

